  "prefLabel": "Fis 803.08 Importation of Fish",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 803.08 Importation of Fish.\n\n(a) Fish, other than non-controlled fish species, shall not be imported from any source that has not filed a report of pathological inspection meeting the criteria set forth in Fis 803.09 and Fis 803.10 so as to ensure that the fish being imported are free of disease-causing pathogens.\n\n(b) No warmwater species of fish shall be imported from zone 2.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fis 800) #5507, eff 11-20-92; amd by #6177, eff 1-27-96; ss by #6889, eff 11-21-98, EXPIRED: 11-21-06\n\nNew. #8767, INTERIM, eff 11-22-06, EXPIRED: 5-21-07\n\nNew. #8893, 6-5-07, EXPIRED: 6-5-15\n\nNew. #10868, INTERIM, eff 6-25-15, EXPIRED: 12-22-15\n\nNew. #11029, eff 1-26-16; ss by #12768, eff 5-3-19; ss by #14558, eff 4-21-26, EXPIRES: 4-21-36",
